sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FC as Flight Controller UART
    participant MAVR as mav_primary
    participant MAVE as mav_ext_cloud
    participant TUN as VPN tunnel wg-cloud
    participant GCS as Remote GCS UDP

    Note over FC,GCS: Data plane — bytes do not pass through DSPatch

    FC->>MAVR: MAVLink frames
    MAVR->>MAVE: route to extender endpoint
    MAVE->>TUN: UDP bind to tunnel IP
    TUN->>GCS: encrypted MAVLink over VPN
    GCS->>TUN: return traffic
    TUN->>MAVE: inbound MAVLink
    MAVE->>MAVR: inject to primary router
    MAVR->>FC: forward to FC
